# Multisensor Agentic Anomaly Detection System

This project implements a software-only prototype for an agentic anomaly detection and diagnosis system for multisensor data.

It includes:
- synthetic sensor simulation
- anomaly detection logic
- root-cause diagnosis heuristics
- decision-support agent policy
- FastAPI endpoint service
- Streamlit dashboard
- Docker Compose automation

## Run locally

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python run_demo.py
```

## API

```bash
python -m uvicorn app.api:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload
```

Open: http://localhost:8000/docs

## Dashboard

```bash
streamlit run app/dashboard.py --server.port 8501
```

## Docker Compose

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

## Example agent output

```json
{
  "status": "warning",
  "anomaly_count": 2,
  "severity": "high",
  "likely_root_cause": "compressor_thermal_overload",
  "confidence": 0.88,
  "recommendations": [
    "Check cooling loop and thermal load",
    "Inspect compressor for imbalance",
    "Review recent parameter changes"
  ]
}
```
